      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">HormuzTracker.tech is a free, informational monitoring platform that provides real-time and near-real-time data about the Strait of Hormuz crisis. The Service includes, but is not limited to, the following features:</p>
      <ul class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
        <li>Live dashboard displaying strait transit status, vessel counts, and crisis severity metrics</li>
        <li>Interactive maps showing vessel positions and shipping lane status</li>
        <li>Oil and energy commodity price tracking, including Brent crude, WTI, and refined product prices</li>
        <li>War risk insurance premium monitoring and P&I club coverage status</li>
        <li>Carrier suspension tracking with surcharge information</li>
        <li>Vessel seizure and incident reporting</li>
        <li>Crisis timeline and diplomatic development tracking</li>
        <li>Regional economic impact analysis</li>
        <li>Alternative shipping route comparisons</li>
        <li>Historical crisis comparisons</li>
        <li>Analysis blog and editorial content</li>
        <li>Email alert subscriptions</li>
