      <ul class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
        <li><strong class="text-slate-200">Vessel Tracking Data:</strong> Vessel positions are derived from AIS (Automatic Identification System) transponders. Ships may disable transponders in conflict zones, meaning the data represents a lower bound of actual vessel activity. We cannot guarantee the completeness or accuracy of vessel tracking information.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-200">Oil Price Data:</strong> Commodity prices are sourced from third-party APIs and may lag real-time market conditions by up to 5 minutes. Prices displayed may differ from those on regulated exchanges. Do not use this data for trading decisions.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-200">Insurance Data:</strong> War risk insurance premiums and P&I club coverage status are based on publicly available reports and may not reflect the most current underwriting decisions. Actual insurance terms are determined by individual insurers and brokers.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-200">Crisis Timeline:</strong> Events and dates in the crisis timeline are based on verified news reports and official statements. We strive for accuracy but cannot guarantee that all events are captured or that timing is precise to the minute.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-200">Economic Impact:</strong> Regional economic impact figures are estimates based on trade flow analysis and economic modeling. Actual impacts may vary significantly based on factors not captured in our models.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-200">No Trading Advice:</strong> Nothing on this website constitutes financial or trading advice. You should not rely on any information on this website as a substitute for professional financial advice.</li>
      </ul>
